{"id":"u09","kelas":7,"no":9,"judul":"Tempat dan Petunjuk Arah","title":"Places and Directions","emoji":"🗺️","ringkas":"Tempat umum, kalimat perintah, dan memberi petunjuk arah","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut tempat umum di kota: [[post office]], [[bank]], [[hospital]], [[market]], dan lainnya","bertanya letak tempat: [[Where is ...?]] dan [[Is there a ... near here?]]","memahami dan memberi petunjuk arah: [[go straight]], [[turn left]], [[turn right]]","memakai kalimat perintah dan [[Don't ...]] untuk rambu dan aturan","menggunakan preposisi tempat: [[opposite]], [[at the corner]], [[between]], [[next to]]"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Pernahkah kamu tersesat atau ditanya jalan oleh turis? Di **Unit 9** kamu belajar menyebut **tempat-tempat di kota** serta **menanyakan dan memberi petunjuk arah** dalam bahasa Inggris. Ini keterampilan yang sangat berguna!"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Tempat di kota (Places in town)","items":[{"en":"post office","id":"kantor pos","ex":"I send a letter at the post office."},{"en":"bank","id":"bank","ex":"My father works at the bank."},{"en":"hospital","id":"rumah sakit","ex":"The doctor is in the hospital."},{"en":"market","id":"pasar","ex":"Mom buys vegetables at the market."},{"en":"supermarket","id":"supermarket","ex":"The supermarket is big."},{"en":"bus station","id":"terminal bus","ex":"The bus station is near here."},{"en":"train station","id":"stasiun kereta","ex":"We meet at the train station."},{"en":"police station","id":"kantor polisi","ex":"The police station is on Jalan Merdeka."},{"en":"mosque","id":"masjid","ex":"The mosque is next to the park."},{"en":"church","id":"gereja","ex":"The church is on the corner."},{"en":"park","id":"taman","ex":"We play in the park."},{"en":"restaurant","id":"restoran","ex":"Let's eat at the restaurant."},{"en":"bookstore","id":"toko buku","ex":"I buy books at the bookstore."},{"en":"pharmacy","id":"apotek","ex":"The pharmacy sells medicine."},{"en":"museum","id":"museum","ex":"We visit the museum on Saturday."},{"en":"traffic light","id":"lampu lalu lintas","ex":"Stop at the traffic light."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Bertanya letak tempat","text":"Gunakan salah satu dari pola ini. Awali dengan **Excuse me** supaya sopan.","table":[["Pertanyaan","Artinya"],["[[Excuse me, where is the bank?]]","Permisi, di mana bank?"],["[[Is there a post office near here?]]","Apakah ada kantor pos di dekat sini?"],["[[How do I get to the hospital?]]","Bagaimana cara ke rumah sakit?"],["[[Can you tell me the way to the station?]]","Bisakah kamu menunjukkan jalan ke stasiun?"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Petunjuk arah (Directions)","table":[["Ungkapan","Artinya"],["[[Go straight.]]","Jalan lurus."],["[[Turn left.]]","Belok kiri."],["[[Turn right.]]","Belok kanan."],["[[Cross the street.]]","Menyeberang jalan."],["[[Go past the bank.]]","Lewati bank."],["[[Take the first street on the left.]]","Ambil jalan pertama di sebelah kiri."],["[[Stop at the traffic light.]]","Berhenti di lampu lalu lintas."],["[[It's at the corner.]]","Letaknya di sudut jalan."],["[[It's on your left / on your right.]]","Letaknya di sebelah kirimu / kananmu."],["[[It's about two hundred meters.]]","Jaraknya sekitar dua ratus meter."]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Left dan right","text":"**Left** = kiri dan **right** = kanan. Hati-hati, **right** juga berarti \"benar\". Dengarkan konteksnya: [[Turn right.]] (belok kanan) dan [[That's right.]] (itu benar)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Menjelaskan letak dengan preposisi","text":"Tambahan preposisi dari Unit 5 untuk menjelaskan letak sebuah tempat:","table":[["Preposisi","Artinya","Contoh"],["**opposite**","di seberang / berhadapan","[[The bank is opposite the park.]]"],["**next to**","di sebelah","[[The market is next to the mosque.]]"],["**between**","di antara","[[The pharmacy is between the bank and the bookstore.]]"],["**on the corner**","di sudut jalan","[[The post office is on the corner.]]"],["**in front of**","di depan","[[The bus stop is in front of the school.]]"],["**behind**","di belakang","[[The park is behind the museum.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Kalimat perintah dan larangan","text":"Untuk memberi arah, kita memakai **kalimat perintah** (kata kerja dasar, tanpa subjek). Untuk **melarang**, pakai **Don't + kata kerja dasar**. Perintah ini juga muncul di rambu-rambu.","table":[["Perintah / larangan","Artinya"],["[[Turn left.]]","Belok kiri."],["[[Please walk slowly.]]","Tolong berjalan pelan-pelan."],["[[Don't run.]]","Jangan berlari."],["[[Don't park here.]]","Jangan parkir di sini."],["[[Don't litter.]]","Jangan buang sampah sembarangan."],["[[Be careful!]]","Hati-hati!"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Menanyakan jalan ke kantor pos","lines":[{"who":"Tourist","en":"Excuse me. Is there a post office near here?","id":"Permisi. Apakah ada kantor pos di dekat sini?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Yes, there is. Go straight on this street.","id":"Ya, ada. Jalan lurus di jalan ini."},{"who":"Tourist","en":"Okay. And then?","id":"Baik. Lalu?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Turn left at the traffic light. The post office is on your right, opposite the park.","id":"Belok kiri di lampu lalu lintas. Kantor posnya ada di sebelah kananmu, di seberang taman."},{"who":"Tourist","en":"Thank you very much!","id":"Terima kasih banyak!"},{"who":"Rani","en":"You're welcome.","id":"Sama-sama."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Menuju stasiun","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Excuse me, how do I get to the train station?","id":"Permisi, bagaimana cara ke stasiun kereta?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"It's not far. Walk two blocks and turn right.","id":"Tidak jauh. Jalan dua blok lalu belok kanan."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Is it next to the market?","id":"Apakah di sebelah pasar?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"Yes, it is. It's about three hundred meters from here.","id":"Ya. Jaraknya sekitar tiga ratus meter dari sini."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Bertanya: [[Excuse me, where is ...?]], [[Is there a ... near here?]], [[How do I get to ...?]]","Arah: [[go straight]], [[turn left]], [[turn right]], [[cross the street]], [[go past ...]].","Letak: [[opposite]], [[next to]], [[between]], [[on the corner]], [[in front of]], [[behind]].","Perintah = kata kerja dasar. Larangan = [[Don't + kata kerja dasar]].","Selalu sopan: awali dengan [[Excuse me]] dan akhiri dengan [[Thank you]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tempat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["post office","kantor pos"],["hospital","rumah sakit"],["market","pasar"],["pharmacy","apotek"],["museum","museum"]],"exp":"Tempat umum sering muncul di rambu dan peta.","k":"7ceb2923"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan arah dengan artinya:","pairs":[["go straight","jalan lurus"],["turn left","belok kiri"],["turn right","belok kanan"],["cross the street","menyeberang jalan"]],"exp":"Left = kiri, right = kanan.","k":"debddeb0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu ingin ke apotek untuk membeli obat. Kamu pergi ke...","options":["bookstore","pharmacy","museum","restaurant"],"answer":1,"exp":"pharmacy = apotek.","k":"6f02f33b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu ingin mengirim surat. Kamu pergi ke...","options":["bank","post office","park","mosque"],"answer":1,"exp":"post office = kantor pos.","k":"e49bf71e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Belok kiri.","q":"___ left.","answers":["turn"],"hint":"t _ _ _","exp":"Turn left = belok kiri.","k":"fcba44ca"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jalan lurus.","q":"Go ___.","answers":["straight"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"go straight = jalan lurus.","k":"f60d136c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara yang sopan untuk memulai bertanya jalan adalah...","options":["Where is the bank?","Hey! Bank!","Excuse me, where is the bank?","Bank where?"],"answer":2,"exp":"Excuse me membuat pertanyaan sopan.","k":"512b1ecc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara bertanya \"Apakah ada toko buku di dekat sini?\"","options":["Is there a bookstore near here?","Are there a bookstore near here?","Does there a bookstore near here?","There is a bookstore near here?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Is there a + benda satu?","k":"12f5ec58"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Bank itu di seberang taman.\"","answer":"The bank is opposite the park.","exp":"The + tempat + is opposite + the + tempat.","k":"eb5d6672"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Belok kanan di lampu lalu lintas.\"","answer":"Turn right at the traffic light.","exp":"Turn right + at + the traffic light.","k":"3c204796"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rumah sakit ada di antara bank dan toko buku. Kita bilang...","options":["The hospital is between the bank and the bookstore.","The hospital is next between the bank.","The hospital is in between bank bookstore.","The hospital between is the bank."],"answer":0,"exp":"between A and B = di antara A dan B.","k":"f5edd99a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rambu \"Don't run\" artinya...","options":["Berlarilah.","Jangan berlari.","Jalan pelan-pelan.","Berhenti."],"answer":1,"exp":"Don't = jangan.","k":"643a290c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Ke arah mana?","say":"Turn right at the corner","options":["Belok kanan di sudut jalan","Belok kiri di sudut jalan","Jalan lurus di sudut jalan","Berhenti di sudut jalan"],"answer":0,"exp":"turn right = belok kanan.","k":"be2d765b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang ditanyakan?","say":"Is there a hospital near here","options":["Apakah ada rumah sakit di dekat sini?","Di mana rumah sakitnya?","Rumah sakitnya jauh?","Kapan rumah sakitnya buka?"],"answer":0,"exp":"near here = di dekat sini.","k":"8df46f30"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Don't parks here.","Don't park here.","Doesn't park here.","Not park here."],"answer":1,"exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"52b3a95f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"It's about two hundred meters\" menjelaskan...","options":["arah","jarak","waktu","harga"],"answer":1,"exp":"meters = jarak.","k":"09419b56"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tempat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["bank","bank"],["supermarket","supermarket"],["bus station","terminal bus"],["train station","stasiun kereta"],["police station","kantor po