wer":0,"exp":"Is there a ...?","k":"cc628201"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"Cross the street\" adalah...","options":["Menyeberang jalan.","Belok kiri.","Berhenti.","Jalan lurus."],"answer":0,"exp":"Cross = menyeberang.","k":"a144d96f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"Don't litter\" adalah...","options":["Jangan buang sampah sembarangan.","Jangan berlari.","Jangan parkir.","Jangan bicara."],"answer":0,"exp":"litter = membuang sampah sembarangan.","k":"63d2e46f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Belok kanan.","q":"Turn ___.","answers":["right"],"hint":"r _ _ _ _","exp":"right = kanan.","k":"e8ec564e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bank itu di seberang taman.","q":"The bank is ___ the park.","answers":["opposite"],"hint":"o _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"opposite = di seberang.","k":"c1c08bc8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berhenti di lampu lalu lintas.","q":"Stop at the ___ light.","answers":["traffic"],"hint":"t _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"traffic light.","k":"60a274db"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Jalan lurus dua blok.\"","answer":"Go straight for two blocks.","exp":"Go straight + for + jumlah + blocks.","k":"9337d580"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Di mana stasiun kereta?\"","answer":"Where is the train station?","exp":"Where is + the train station?","k":"65f69b10"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kantor pos ada di sudut jalan.\"","answer":"The post office is on the corner.","exp":"The post office + is + on the corner.","k":"5f5be35e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Ke arah mana?","say":"Turn left and go straight","options":["Belok kiri lalu jalan lurus","Belok kanan lalu jalan lurus","Jalan lurus lalu belok kiri","Berhenti"],"answer":0,"exp":"Turn left → go straight.","k":"a48126c9"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Di mana tempatnya?","say":"The hospital is opposite the bank","options":["Di seberang bank","Di sebelah bank","Di belakang bank","Di depan bank"],"answer":0,"exp":"opposite = di seberang.","k":"895a13e2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Go straight on this street. Turn left at the traffic light. The bank is on your right.\" Di mana bank?","options":["Di sebelah kanan","Di sebelah kiri","Di depan lampu","Di belakang taman"],"answer":0,"exp":"on your right.","k":"f860b8d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"The post office is opposite the park. The pharmacy is next to the post office.\" Apotek ada di mana?","options":["Di sebelah kantor pos","Di seberang taman","Di dalam taman","Di belakang bank"],"answer":0,"exp":"next to the post office.","k":"4e67ef9b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My school is near the market. There is a mosque between the school and the market.\" Apa yang ada di antara sekolah dan pasar?","options":["Masjid","Taman","Bank","Rumah sakit"],"answer":0,"exp":"mosque.","k":"06a0ba4d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Excuse me, how do I get to the hospital?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Go straight and turn right.","It's twelve o'clock.","It's delicious.","I'm fine."],"answer":0,"exp":"arah.","k":"cee231a5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Is there a bookstore near here?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Yes, there is. It's next to the bank.","Yes, it is. It's a book.","No, I'm not.","Thank you, I'm twelve."],"answer":0,"exp":"Is there ...?","k":"aab42d67"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["Turn to left.","Turn left.","Turn right.","Go straight."],"answer":0,"exp":"Turn left tanpa to.","k":"c1beb518"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["The bank is in the opposite of park.","The bank is opposite the park.","The bank is next to the park.","The bank is behind the park."],"answer":0,"exp":"opposite the park.","k":"735c1133"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["Don't running here.","Don't run here.","Don't park here.","Don't litter."],"answer":0,"exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"71a5abf4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Letaknya di sudut jalan\" adalah...","options":["It's at the corner.","It's in the corner of road.","It's corner at.","It's on corner of."],"answer":0,"exp":"at the corner.","k":"24a1b479"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Jalan lurus lalu belok kiri\" adalah...","options":["Go straight and then turn left.","Go straight then turn to the left of.","Straight go and left turn.","Going straight turning left."],"answer":0,"exp":"Go straight, turn left.","k":"2d38707a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["turn left","museum","bank","hospital"],"answer":0,"exp":"turn left = arah.","k":"7f7a7f00"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berhenti di lampu merah.","q":"___ at the red light.","answers":["stop"],"hint":"s _ _ _","exp":"Stop.","k":"b00667a9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menyeberang jalan dengan hati-hati.","q":"___ the street carefully.","answers":["cross"],"hint":"c _ _ _ _","exp":"Cross.","k":"ca38a10e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Taman itu ada di belakang museum.","q":"The park is ___ the museum.","answers":["behind"],"hint":"b _ _ _ _ _","exp":"behind.","k":"05ae2ca6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pasar ada di dekat sini.","q":"The market is ___ here.","answers":["near"],"hint":"n _ _ _","exp":"near.","k":"3a4b377d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Belok kanan di sudut jalan.\"","answer":"Turn right at the corner.","exp":"Turn right + at the corner.","k":"cf9c67ca"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah ada apotek di dekat sini?\"","answer":"Is there a pharmacy near here?","exp":"Is there + a + tempat + near here?","k":"04bdbdf1"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Ke mana arahnya?","say":"Go straight and turn left at the traffic light","options":["Jalan lurus lalu belok kiri di lampu lalu lintas","Belok kanan di lampu","Berhenti di taman","Menyeberang jalan"],"answer":0,"exp":"straight; left.","k":"701d070d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Di mana tempatnya?","say":"The museum is behind the park","options":["Di belakang taman","Di depan taman","Di sebelah taman","Di seberang taman"],"answer":0,"exp":"behind.","k":"8301ce26"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Turis bertanya, \"Excuse me, where is the bank?\" Bank ada di seberang taman. Jawabanmu?","options":["It's opposite the park.","It's at the park opposite.","It is park opposite.","Opposite it the park is."],"answer":0,"exp":"opposite.","k":"4e7a1962"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu tersesat dan ingin bertanya jalan ke stasiun. Apa yang kamu katakan?","options":["Excuse me, how do I get to the station?","Station where you?","Hey, station!","I station go?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Excuse me.","k":"15501055"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["hospital","hospitel","hospitle","hosspital"],"answer":0,"exp":"hospital.","k":"9f5d0a22"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["supermarket","supermarked","supermarkit","supermarkett"],"answer":0,"exp":"supermarket.","k":"7781b5bb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["straight","strate","straigt","stright"],"answer":0,"exp":"straight.","k":"da36780b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is the museum?\" (Di dekat taman.)","options":["Where","What","Who","How many"],"answer":0,"exp":"Where.","k":"a1d2e164"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ far is the station?\" (Dua ratus meter.)","options":["How","What","Who","Where is"],"answer":0,"exp":"How far.","k":"ae19e71b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"Turn ___ at the corner.\" (kiri)","options":["left","right","straight","stop"],"answer":0,"exp":"left.","k":"d18c0a9a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"The market is ___ the bank and the mosque.\"","options":["between","behind","under","on"],"answer":0,"exp":"between.","k":"9b8e4495"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"The post office is ___ the corner.\"","options":["on","in","at to","under"],"answer":0,"exp":"on the corner.","k":"2bec1b77"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"Go ___ for two blocks.\"","options":["straight","right turn","stop at","corner"],"answer":0,"exp":"straight.","k":"88281184"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat larangan yang benar